<IfController guiclass="IfControllerPanel" testclass="IfController" testname="01 Dashboard and analytics / head-analytics" enabled="true"><stringProp name="IfController.condition">${__groovy(vars.get(&quot;enabled_head-analytics&quot;) == &quot;true&quot;)}</stringProp><boolProp name="IfController.evaluateAll">false</boolProp><boolProp name="IfController.useExpression">true</boolProp></IfController><hashTree><HTTPSamplerProxy guiclass="HttpTestSampleGui" testclass="HTTPSamplerProxy" testname="PERF | head-analytics | Analytics HTML and initial component" enabled="true"><elementProp name="HTTPsampler.Arguments" elementType="Arguments"><collectionProp name="Arguments.arguments"/></elementProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.domain">127.0.0.1</stringProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.port">1</stringProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.protocol">http</stringProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.path">/configuration-required</stringProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.method">GET</stringProp><boolProp name="HTTPSampler.follow_redirects">false</boolProp><boolProp name="HTTPSampler.auto_redirects">false</boolProp><boolProp name="HTTPSampler.use_keepalive">true</boolProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.connect_timeout">10000</stringProp><stringProp name="HTTPSampler.response_timeout">120000</stringProp></HTTPSamplerProxy><hashTree><HeaderManager guiclass="HeaderPanel" testclass="HeaderManager" testname="Request headers" enabled="true"><collectionProp name="HeaderManager.headers"><elementProp name="User-Agent" elementType="Header"><stringProp name="Header.name">User-Agent</stringProp><stringProp name="Header.value">ATHENA-Capstone-JMeter</stringProp></elementProp></collectionProp></HeaderManager><hashTree/><JSR223PreProcessor guiclass="TestBeanGUI" testclass="JSR223PreProcessor" testname="Prepare request and session" enabled="true"><stringProp name="scriptLanguage">groovy</stringProp><stringProp name="parameters">head-analytics</stringProp><stringProp name="filename"></stringProp><stringProp name="cacheKey">true</stringProp><stringProp name="script">import groovy.json.JsonOutput
import groovy.json.JsonSlurper
import org.apache.jmeter.protocol.http.control.Cookie

def config = vars.getObject('athena.config')
def user = vars.getObject('athena.user')
def id = Parameters
def op = id == 'session' ? [path: config.dashboard, method:'GET'] : config.operations.find { it.id == id }
if (id != 'session') {
    def prefix = vars.getIteration() &lt;= config.warmupLoops ? 'WARMUP' : 'PERF'
